w20-plan-change-notice
----------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Joon-Seok Kim, Eugene Agichtein, Kai Shu, Liang Zhao and Andreas Züfle.
"When the Plan Changes: A Strategic World Testbed for Dynamic Multi-Agent
Coordination". arXiv:2611.10011, submitted 4 Nov 2026.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.10011
Licence: arXiv.org perpetual, non-exclusive license to distribute
(http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/). That licence is a
grant to arXiv; it gives no reuse rights to others, so only the method idea
is used here.

Method only: the idea of holding the authoritative objective, the local plan,
notice receipt and consequential action as separate records, and of a guard
that handles pending notices before local work. No text, figures, tables,
prompts or data from the paper are copied into this directory. No code was
released with the paper and none is used. The paper's own figures are
recorded only as number tokens with offsets in paper_evidence.json and are
marked UNVERIFIED.
